    "optimizedContext": {
      "value": "# TransitionChange\n## Rules\n- Resolve change schema, refresh tracking, reconcile validity before authorization.\n- Resolve legal target/`next`; evaluate canonical transition bindings and predicates.\n- Run selected hooks/checks before atomic `ChangeRepository.mutate`; persist transition with actor.\n- Verification attempts/evidence and approvals are validity gates, not inferred hops.\n## Constraints\n- Entity owns edges; use case never invents them.\n- Skip hooks never skips predicates.",
